| [0.75, 1.00] | 2040 | 87.25% | 95.05% | 1.496 |
| All | 16384 | 95.29% | 95.50% | 1.044 |

The constant band has width 1.126. The fitted scale is max(0.01, 0.213 + 0.106 x).
